# steps/free-names.md (class D): `r: k` with the caller's char k into a size_t -- refused at the statement as the
# same char declared in peek is.  Before M2: "assignment value has unknown type".
fn: peek () size_t
    size_t: r 0U
    r: k
    return: r
fn: m () size_t
    char: k 'a'
    return: peek()

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
